  m_Name: Line 10
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _lines:
  - '"You...lie? You truly do not seek *That*? I know, perhaps, I supposed, I, Mushi
    Man, could grant you an audience anew. Why have you delved here, being-not-from-this-world?
    I already know why, of course, so there is no use lying."'
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - '"I represent an otherwordly, extra dimensional public-safety division, sent
    here to neutralize *That*"'
